    "q-2673": {
      "dom_id": "step-q2673",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$(q+6)(q+2)=$",
      "worked_solution": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(q+6)(q+2) & = \\\\ q(q+2)+6(q+2) & = \\\\ {q}^{2}+2q+6q+12 & = \\\\ {q}^{2}+8q+12\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
